  "slug": "calibration-quality-report-form",
  "title": "Calibration Quality Report Form",
  "subtitle": "Reconcile the measurement equipment calibration and status control population, summarize evidence and trends, separate limitations from conclusions, assign decisions, and track follow-up.",
  "description": "A decision-ready calibration quality report form that turns source records for a measuring instrument, standard, or gage into reconciled measures, exception patterns, qualified conclusions, owned actions, and a retrievable reporting package.",
  "use_case": "Use when the metrology or quality review owner needs a bounded quality report for the measurement equipment calibration and status control rather than a raw inspection checklist or chronological log.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
